# Git-backed work

- Make code changes only inside a valid Git repository or registered worktree.
- Before editing, confirm the intended branch and repository status.
- Never deploy code from an untracked copy, ad hoc temporary directory, or directory with missing Git metadata.
- Before deployment, require the exact deployed source to be committed on a named branch and record that branch and commit.
- Keep unrelated branches and other contributors' work out of the active scope unless explicitly requested.
